  "description": "Reid Classic 20 | 20 inch kids' bike\nThe perfect bike for 6–9 year olds, the Reid Classic 20\" Kids' Bike combines timeless vintage styling with child-friendly design and reliable performance for everyday adventures.\nInspired by our iconic adult Classic bikes, the Classic 20\" features elegant retro styling with junior-sized components and geometry designed for growing riders. Available in a range of beautiful colours, it’s a stylish kids' bike that looks great while providing a comfortable and confident ride.\nDual-pivot front calliper brakes provide responsive stopping power and help young riders develop their hand-braking skills, while the rear coaster brake offers a familiar and intuitive back-pedal braking system.\nLightweight and versatile, the Classic 20\" is ideal for family bike rides, school commutes, trips to the park and exploring local bike paths. It’s designed to make every ride enjoyable while helping young riders build confidence on two wheels.\nWho is the Classic 20 for?\nThe Classic 20\" Kids' Bike is ideal for:\n\n6–9 year olds ready for a larger kids' bike\nYoung riders building confidence with pedalling, steering and braking\nChildren looking for a stylish bike with classic vintage-inspired design\nParents wanting a comfortable and practical bike for growing riders\nEveryday adventures, from school commutes and park trips to family bike rides\n\nFind the right fit\nChoosing the right bike size helps your child ride comfortably, confidently and safely. Use our Kids' Bike Size Guide by clicking the tab above to find the right Reid bike based on your child's height and age.",
